<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-PAKISTAN V NEW ZEALAND SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN V NEW ZEALAND SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard</p>
<p>in the Singer Champions' Trophy tournament between Pakistan and</p>
<p>New Zealand on Wednesday.</p>
<p>New Zealand</p>
<p> B. Young lbw b Shahid Nazir			  2</p>
<p> C. Spearman c Moin Khan b Shahid Nazir	   2</p>
<p> A. Parore c Shahid Afridi b Waqar Younis	78</p>
<p> N. Astle c Moin Khan b Waqar Younis		6</p>
<p> C. Cairns b Waqar Younis			    18</p>
<p> M. Greatbatch lbw b Waqar Younis		   0</p>
<p> C. Harris lbw b Waqar Younis			 1</p>
<p> L. Germon run out				     52</p>
<p> D. Patel b Waqar Younis				2</p>
<p> S. Doull not out					 3</p>
<p> D. Morrison c Salim Malik b Saqlain Mushtaq    0</p>
<p> Extras (lb-5 w-20 nb-3)			     28</p>
<p> Total (all out, 50 overs)			  192</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-2 2-7 3-28 4-57 5-57 6-60 7-175 8-187</p>
<p>9-191</p>
<p>Bowling: Waqar Younis 10-1-44-6 (8w), Shahid Nazir 7-1-35-2</p>
<p>(3nb, 9w), Mushtaq Ahmed 10-0-30-0 (2w), Saqlain Mushtaq</p>
<p>10-1-30-1, Shahid Afridi 7-1-26-0, Salim Malik 6-0-22-0 (1w).</p>
<p>Pakistan</p>
<p>Saeed Anwar c Greatbatch b Harris     54</p>
<p>Aamir Sohail c Parore b Cairns	  25</p>
<p>Ijaz Ahmed c Germon b Astle	     16</p>
<p>Salim Malik c Germon b Morrison	 41</p>
<p>Hasan Raza lbw b Cairns		    1</p>
<p>Moin Khan not out			   37</p>
<p>Shahid Afridi b Cairns		     3</p>
<p>Saqlain Mushtaq not out		    5</p>
<p>Extras (lb-3 nb-2 w-9)		     14</p>
<p>Total (for 6 wickets, 48.3 overs)    196</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-66 2-101 3-109 4-113 5-181 6-187</p>
<p>Did not bat: Waqar Younis, Mushtaq Ahmed, Shahid Nazir.</p>
<p>Bowling: Morrison 8-0-46-1 (nb1, w2), Doull 0.2-0-7-0 (w-5),</p>
<p>Astle 9.4-0-29-1, Patel 10-2-60-0 (w1), Harris 10-1-27-1 (nb1),</p>
<p>Cairns 10-2-18-3, Spearman 0.3-0-6-0 (w1).</p>
<p>Result: Pakistan won by six wickets.</p>
<p>Final: Pakistan v New Zealand, on Friday.</p>
